{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41160","headline":"衔命还国作 · 朝衡","name":"衔命还国作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衔命将辞国，非才忝侍臣。\n天中恋明主，海外忆慈亲。\n伏奏违金阙，騑骖去玉津。\n蓬莱乡路远，若木故园林。\n西望怀恩日，东归感义辰。\n平生一宝劒，留赠结交人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朝衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}